    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Instruction-aware User Embedding via Synergistic <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> and Representation <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modeling</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gao%2C+Z">Ziyi Gao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xu%2C+Y">Yike Xu</a>, 
      
