    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        UALM: Unified Audio <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> for Understanding, Generation and Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tian%2C+J">Jinchuan Tian</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lee%2C+S">Sang-gil Lee</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kong%2C+Z">Zhifeng Kong</a>, 
      
